# Update 144 (code on GitHub, dzepdzep/Voltcap › main): kept off GitHub.
# Discord's Social SDK: files up to 290 MB (GitHub's limit is 100 MB) and Discord's terms don't allow sharing it —
# whoever builds Voltcap downloads it from discord.com/developers into app/libs/discord.
/app/libs/discord/
# Claude's working copies (the real files are in app/ and the project root).
/src_copy/
/project_copy/
/Claude outputs/
# Your screenshots from the handhelds.
/screens/
# Logs, Python caches.
*.log
__pycache__/

# Claude screenshots / device pulls (not source)
shots*/

# QA runs: recordings, frame stats and dumps pulled from the handhelds (tools/qa)
/qa_runs/

# Update 421: local QA captures, owner reference pictures and backups never go to GitHub (the commit tool adds everything).
